{"file": "退役归来，这个保镖不好惹-第13集.mp4", "ep": 13, "duration": 109.8, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.8, "text": "只要我不死"}, {"start": 1.44, "end": 2.52, "text": "你女儿就是安全的"}, {"start": 3.65, "end": 4.09, "text": "好"}, {"start": 4.68, "end": 6.48, "text": "这五万块算我个人借给你的"}, {"start": 6.8, "end": 7.8, "text": "走公司太繁瑣"}, {"start": 8.16, "end": 9.36, "text": "等河从结束再接清"}, {"start": 10.24, "end": 11.0, "text": "什么时候上班"}, {"start": 11.16, "end": 12.12, "text": "看你什么时候方便"}, {"start": 12.44, "end": 12.96, "text": "明天"}, {"start": 13.16, "end": 13.6, "text": "好"}, {"start": 14.8, "end": 16.48, "text": "明天早上我安排人来接你"}, {"start": 19.75, "end": 20.19, "text": "哥"}, {"start": 20.43, "end": 21.71, "text": "学校那边真这么说"}, {"start": 23.26, "end": 24.02, "text": "都安排好了"}, {"start": 25.62, "end": 26.86, "text": "那我今天就想回学校"}, {"start": 27.26, "end": 27.86, "text": "哥送你"}, {"start": 29.97, "end": 30.41, "text": "哥"}, {"start": 30.65, "end": 32.53, "text": "刚才那位张总找你什么事啊"}, {"start": 33.38, "end": 34.18, "text": "工作上的事"}, {"start": 34.58, "end": 35.7, "text": "工作"}, {"start": 36.06, "end": 37.47, "text": "我已经找到工作了"}, {"start": 38.37, "end": 39.09, "text": "明天上班"}, {"start": 39.61, "end": 40.29, "text": "公司助理"}, {"start": 41.86, "end": 42.78, "text": "那挺好的呀"}, {"start": 43.71, "end": 44.15, "text": "婷婷"}, {"start": 45.7, "end": 46.1, "text": "拿着"}, {"start": 46.3, "end": 46.86, "text": "生活费"}, {"start": 48.55, "end": 48.95, "text": "哥"}, {"start": 49.03, "end": 49.83, "text": "不用这么多"}, {"start": 50.07, "end": 51.03, "text": "你刚找到工作"}, {"start": 51.11, "end": 52.19, "text": "自己还得用钱呢"}, {"start": 52.51, "end": 52.95, "text": "我有"}, {"start": 53.23, "end": 53.91, "text": "可是"}, {"start": 54.03, "end": 54.43, "text": "拿着"}, {"start": 56.0, "end": 57.04, "text": "落下的课慢慢补"}, {"start": 57.44, "end": 57.88, "text": "别急"}, {"start": 59.31, "end": 60.19, "text": "身体也得顾着"}, {"start": 61.42, "end": 62.22, "text": "知道了 哥"}, {"start": 64.02, "end": 64.82, "text": "东西带齐了"}, {"start": 65.54, "end": 66.06, "text": "都齐了"}, {"start": 66.86, "end": 67.22, "text": "走"}, {"start": 67.42, "end": 68.26, "text": "哥送你去学校"}, {"start": 68.42, "end": 68.78, "text": "好"}, {"start": 71.1, "end": 71.42, "text": "哥"}, {"start": 71.74, "end": 72.78, "text": "你明天就要上班了"}, {"start": 73.06, "end": 74.1, "text": "以后还回家住吗"}, {"start": 74.66, "end": 75.34, "text": "工作需要"}, {"start": 75.66, "end": 76.46, "text": "可能住在外面"}, {"start": 76.7, "end": 79.42, "text": "那我们是不是又要很久"}, {"start": 79.42, "end": 80.06, "text": "见不到了"}, {"start": 81.08, "end": 82.0, "text": "就在这个城市"}, {"start": 82.48, "end": 83.28, "text": "又不是回部队"}, {"start": 83.92, "end": 84.48, "text": "放假了"}, {"start": 84.76, "end": 85.28, "text": "哥来看你"}, {"start": 87.9, "end": 88.54, "text": "不许骗人"}, {"start": 94.07, "end": 95.51, "text": "你工作也别太累了"}, {"start": 95.75, "end": 96.55, "text": "记得按时吃饭"}, {"start": 97.58, "end": 98.02, "text": "知道了"}, {"start": 98.26, "end": 106.13, "text": "你能回学校读书了"}]}